			Ion</i>, <i>and ancestor of the Achaei.</i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A king of Lydia</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. Ib.
			301</span></i>.</div>
